{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c52450c46309346075970e448b33ea806c2df6f8860e4fcd89cd8ddee04f7f52",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7208b193f5db25f97454dfaadd7921692dab68442c711c7df381d4ff0767eff5",
      "text": "伊集院北斗的特别日子",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e6e29ab82c2ae262ff3810ee624307ba62e6ac178dd5e50dd2f069b6a44988f",
      "text": "冬马和翔太在准备为北斗庆祝生日。\n但生日当天是情人节，\n两人怀疑北斗是否有空。\n另一方面，北斗却称生日已有约，\n回绝了女性的约会邀请……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7208b193f5db25f97454dfaadd7921692dab68442c711c7df381d4ff0767eff5",
      "text": "伊集院北斗的特别日子",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d32e1237a22444788605e0927c5d6726ce47e18e1fb726736dbd59601eb480b",
      "text": "啊！冬马君在看好时髦的食谱书。\n什么时候做呀？也要给我准备一份哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a28b31226984219a025d08f244c9c23232cc882848768170ae640ec592157965",
      "text": "哦。……马上就是北斗的生日了嘛，\n想稍微下点血本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:500ffc521113fe58b1e764f525d537785e2fa649260d65b94fc56faa43b876a7",
      "text": "哇～！那也做这个嘛，还有这个、这个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a58453dedb57097225e1f06f9c33fbc9b91458d19c8a16333beb6185ac194cd",
      "text": "又不是你过生日……\n嘛，做做倒也无所谓啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be0b156605941480412456547b7cad5b8a6e55f36e75c2f83b67d2f794f7a240",
      "text": "放心啦～我会好好挑\n北斗君会喜欢的东西的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2878e93d76dbfced7d3191b8946beda77cc2ec5f8ba9df17f48a8e38666d36e3",
      "text": "说起来，有问过最重要的北斗君的日程吗？\n北斗君的生日可是2月14日哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aaa75da3cdd5274eb0a8fe6083f4f238a1dab6468fdb1b59cbecc738642a7ba5",
      "text": "糟……糟糕！\n本来想给他发LINK的结果给忘了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dc68a5e26e15f235790e77b92a303127708e10b2cff448886eb2d21e650eb3d",
      "text": "既是生日又是情人节，\n说不定早就被约满了吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9337c3859066149a214b953457cf4f9b5492a1a22b09c945c0c8af404dae2ae7",
      "text": "啊哈哈，也是呢。按北斗君的性子，\n早中晚大概都被约会排满了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c53bc232d7cea6a00527434d015cf77a22a2ff1c94f4606d2e83e43e8867aae6",
      "text": "很有可能啊……算了，总之先问问看\n能不能抽空挤出点时间吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b5ab1ce0f73e8a443a1fa21aff2de7d2bd49dbc9d7b49fe2fb83f83c2b6a771",
      "text": "东京都内某处……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fa06ef8e523eef1902eeabc9d54bdae1f00f616e048bbe387883b118f68f54c",
      "text": "北斗君，今天谢谢你。\n是最棒的约会呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36ea1111a48b6592391e46b86418d6e037511e0a56c3d8d7c76e8650232cad93",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢你。\n我也度过了一段美好的时光。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:821417954e119c67b0abef94f1a1cdc25b2a8b4b99cb8937227ac1b499c92e2b",
      "text": "真的吗？呐，2月14日是你的生日吧。\n不介意的话要不要一起吃个晚饭？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd3e22d699bc67de58ca8e66f46e88b77fb058af9fd702872d664b00836df654",
      "text": "真是诱人的邀请呢。\n但是很抱歉，那天我已经有约了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c09cb92a82576eb6b4438e43a77a1990beffbe90f3788098d303b18b097dfdc",
      "text": "这样啊，\n北斗君果然很受欢迎呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47e4649e5e50117eeefd1569f29514555ca93f9896f4c1a34a4ac12de9e87c9e",
      "text": "我一定会补偿你的。\n请期待我们因未能相见而积攒的时光吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2237aadff9d785d0c6f9f08828a6a79763973ee88d36f8f70c73b181513b8458",
      "text": "真是的，说好了哦。\n不过真嫉妒能陪你一起过生日的人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2be11f07f3d0249afb98ec5f141b6f0668315662edab8f3c47f776cbd7b8c948",
      "text": "呵呵，下次我会给你一个无比精彩的约会，\n让你把这可爱的醋意都忘得一干二净。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e3af6b24bd100b8f7b5658e299de17124ff88d3d5bb9ba3f61cb392cb394198",
      "text": "（不过，那个所谓的先约\n可不是和天使酱的约会呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7461023787749c2397513b2509caaece53b2ec7eb45f29bd06ade085b0549b14",
      "text": "喂，北斗。\n你生日那天有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7d6cf85ec9ee9a2a1cd2c19af7624f08ecdc9ccee70255765f9a85da339a742",
      "text": "我正和冬马君商量说\n想给北斗君办生日派对呢～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43a7f2d52edface7b50fe6201da553366474fba96fa84e3246fd9231f10afac7",
      "text": "嘛，虽然你可能已经有安排了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba22e4efce8409ba5dca2e9ff480795265b8c3e7821fda7a508f89121316f0f6",
      "text": "当然OK啦，一整天都有空。\n只要没有突发的工作就行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7",
      "text": "哎！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5543630d72be1cacc422a9a5ddb1681d4fcb2633c1de022d729416852c41960f",
      "text": "呵呵。我猜你们两个一定会帮我庆祝，\n所以就没排其他行程。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:906aedda273daff6186febb868c28c36a78d1882e42d8dbf8cf220eadefc6107",
      "text": "是、这样啊……嘿嘿。\n很懂嘛，北斗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1025bfebe33860dbaa38eba12a23223ee0cd80972b6945c7e3eecbb76c328f1e",
      "text": "太好啦～♪\n这样就有大餐吃了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3445826bfaa521f617eecfced842dc92f35e4ab56e0842ea4027b75f76fde679",
      "text": "虽然是我主动约的，但原本还以为\n当天你的行程肯定按分钟排满了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bb320ae7c1ac141363629e872148811ba7799ae2c620eebf1981875c8f10a49",
      "text": "既然要办，就要让你觉得选我们而不是女孩子是正确的。\n对吧，冬马君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60378559a1b4de57b40e491784eea82e0f99776233d959e7091b833597044e50",
      "text": "嗯，生日就在我家办派对吧。\n好好期待着吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_c:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72b016f4b33ccac40aa8e7ac473eab5c6cf8bc9ffac018dbdfdd068859cdc5f1",
      "text": "……关于那件事，\n难得有这机会，我想拜托你们一件事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_d:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d49b196ea13d8d7d5243f3e88926df0f0ea0bbbab708b2ccfb7c173f42e4aa3",
      "text": "生日派对当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fea21d2597507fd5a8f2708f4c0790c89b71430918de08b12238d63cc1034a3c",
      "text": "嗯，好香的味道。\n冬马家里有好多香料，真有意思呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:000e8f875af3571dec66204d73a201bc12ebaa58b0b66a62d9e37ee1cb467d86",
      "text": "还行吧。\n啊，看着点锅别煮焦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55a85ee69e767897c8965c3e04a8b38f128681264d5a7dda004c1284958aed7f",
      "text": "收到。冬马做的那个是……花束沙拉吧。\n真意外你还会做这种菜呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d985ceed299c87260b6552e69d2b3ea8919d5e7159fd36c43230e1ac869ecba",
      "text": "冬马君为了今天查了好多资料对吧～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74adc55949ead4318889e3310037250d2fe06a1d92db59dc385af7d378c3e91b",
      "text": "吵、吵死啦！……话说北斗你真的没关系吗。\n难得过个生日还要打下手。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45f1072ff9119218060c77eed7e86a2717c04252f3e3b8380e75a13ac38ec908",
      "text": "嗯。毕竟很少有机会能亲手准备自己的\n生日派对呢，我觉得非常开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_d:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1faff2fffc46afcfeb913c6d7fd7716f9fc77998ee59d79e74e7affe92006996",
      "text": "啊哈哈，北斗君真奇怪呢～\n啊，这个炸物好好吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f35a56beba0ae85b0a405f37c98c4647798609b537158ed54c55037516f90165",
      "text": "啊，你这家伙！\n不准偷吃！再等一会儿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_d:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:498a4a939f1c3b6873092d59331186c0a3c8d97c83fed0f7a0ed2f6b15dfe633",
      "text": "哎～有这么多吃一口没关系的嘛。\n北斗君也，啊——",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_d:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b6571a6ef7277262b531b6cfbf27ece8ea9fd1bcad078abc7468c73db6d3c61",
      "text": "啊——。……嗯，刚出锅的格外好吃呢。\n因为是为我做的料理，所以格外美味吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_e:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:569c671b5d3c980e037e5f732668fbbf34aaf74904961921070b86beb7ac04e9",
      "text": "把这个这样摆……好，大功告成！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:534427700ee4084fbd4d57a37bf8038ace6d8abd68abdc742fd3bc6dca025df1",
      "text": "哇，真不愧是冬马君。\n看起来超～美味♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:090080b5174a2edb6ec0f47f7ee7a1d937f45bfa6c225914095504b501ee966b",
      "text": "像这样全摆出来真壮观呢。\n我也很有成就感哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a13fee642c2aee4042afd5fca027bd8e546a8dd386a213a7b639a0a6058abfe",
      "text": "我送的生日礼物也\n好～好准备了，你就期待着吧。给！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30431c8c30d643e0e9e5cba40399dab1044f73ab37ba2b270895b6717c916025",
      "text": "谢谢。到底是什么呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6e10c0f44c631128c74d1153a3a8d7636a98d9e010c7dc5c2254f4bdd8183e0",
      "text": "一定要一个人的时候才能打开看哦。\n等你的感想！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dff9e30705b49bf3e15b36e3f9f7d78ed36838c30e5df96ab67b1310958605c",
      "text": "制作人也送了慰劳品蛋糕哦。\n说今天因为工作来不了非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_e:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0ae08ae661132b5214459a8c7f5b29355252a05b9efdf187e7abc15f08b751c",
      "text": "太感谢了呢～那个待会儿也吃吧！\n那么，重新来一次……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_e:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e720de7db057f848a4719eb2f137d69dbf23c66873979ee8cc86edd499be3887",
      "text": "生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_e:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd0bb429d23a2e94f62541e93ef17efbfcf6dd84ef6eb7747f8b7e3cff7cb82a",
      "text": "谢谢你们两个。\n对我来说，今天成了非常特别的一天。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
